          "docs": "Lists skill inventories claimed by the workspace, ordered by scan recency."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceNameOrID}/skill-inventories",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.tessl.io/v1/workspaces/:workspaceNameOrID/skill-inventories",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer <token>"
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "workspaceNameOrID",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Creates (or returns) the workspace's skill inventory for a connected SCM provider, deriving the org-equivalent from the workspace's integration. This is the backend-driven bootstrap for the read-only scan model: after connecting a provider, create the inventory here, opt it into private indexing, then start a scan. Returns 422 (scm_not_connected) when the workspace has no integration for the requested provider. `created` is false when the inventory already existed."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceNameOrID}/skill-inventories/{id}",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.tessl.io/v1/workspaces/:workspaceNameOrID/skill-inventories/:id",
