                "name": "provider",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "workspaceNameOrID",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Provider-agnostic, workspace-level preview of a connected SCM source, before any skill inventory exists. Given a `provider` (github, gitlab, or bitbucket), returns whether that provider is connected for the workspace, the connected account/org/group/workspace, and how many repositories the connection can currently see. `repositorySelection` is GitHub-only and is null for other providers."
        },
        {
