          "docs": "One-time opt-in to automatic scanning for a skill inventory. Once opted in, the inventory is covered by the daily scheduled re-scan sweep. This is independent of the private-indexing opt-in: a swept scan only indexes the inventory's skills when it has also opted into private indexing. Returns 409 (already_opted_in) when the inventory has already opted in."
        },
        {
