          },
          "docs": "One-time opt-in to private skill indexing for a skill inventory. Guarded by the inventory's SCM connection readiness check. Returns 422 when the connection is not ready — the error message is the machine-readable, provider-namespaced reason (e.g. github_app_not_installed, github_app_account_mismatch, github_app_unhealthy for GitHub; bitbucket_not_connected, bitbucket_reconnect_required, bitbucket_workspace_mismatch for Bitbucket; gitlab_not_connected, gitlab_scope_mismatch for GitLab) — and 409 "
        },
